          "jcr:created": "Wed Sep 11 2024 20:47:22 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">The LD304 hospital birthing bed at a glance</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The LD304 Birthing Bed is designed to provide comfort and security for both the mother and caregiver. Simple operation, mobility and an ergonomic design to enhance safety while positioning to mom’s comfort.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Patented Lock-Rite foot section glides off for quick and easy breakdown&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Length-adjustable footrests&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Ultra-comfort mattress with integrated, high-memory egg crate topper</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Patented Skoocher feature</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://techweb.stryker.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Operations and maintenance manuals</span></a></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 15 2024 15:59:13 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
