          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Convenient controls<br>\n</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Single-button Trendelenburg and Stryker’s powered Skoocher feature, allow customized positioning on your labor bed with minimal effort.</span></p>\n",
