          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 28 2020 17:00:49 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Ergonomic design<br>\n</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker's foot section promotes proper body mechanics to help prevent caregiver back strain and injury.</span></p>\n",
