          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Patented Skoocher feature</span><br>\n</h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Move mom closer to the perineal edge of the bed with the touch of a button.</span></p>\n",
